Changes of the Raku package "Math::NIntegrate".

0.0.1 2026-09-28
    - First version with:
        - GlobalAdaptive integration strategy
            - Can be given an integration monitor routine as an argument
        - The integration rules:
            - Cartesian, ClenshawCurtis, GaussKronrod, MonteCarlo, MultiDimensional, NewtonCotes, Trapezoidal
        - Singularity handler by Iri, Moriguti, & Takesawa ("IMT rule")
        - Comprehensive integrator spec parsing and interpretation
        - Kahaner integrator tests
        - CLI script
